racer ( ms , it_T , this % mask , areaT ) this % values ( BUDGET_MASS ) = total_mass this % values ( BUDGET_KE ) = total_KE this % values ( BUDGET_SALT_TOTAL ) = total_S this % values ( BUDGET_HEAT_TOTAL ) = total_T end subroutine ocean_budgets_evaluate","tags":"","url":"proc/ocean_budgets_evaluate.html"},{"title":"ocean_budgets_init – Roundabout","text":"private  subroutine ocean_budgets_init(this, grid) Type Bound ocean_budgets_t Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ocean_budgets_t ), intent(inout) :: this type( hgrid_t ), intent(in) :: grid Source Code subroutine ocean_budgets_init ( this , grid ) class ( ocean_budgets_t ), intent ( inout ) :: this type ( hgrid_t ), intent ( in ) :: grid this % grid = grid this % has_snapshot = . false . this % values = 0.0_wp this % values_init = 0.0_wp this % n_contributors = 0 this % n_contributors_max = INITIAL_CONTRIBUTOR_CAPACITY allocate ( this % contributors ( this % n_contributors_max )) this % is_init = . true . end subroutine ocean_budgets_init","tags":"","url":"proc/ocean_budgets_init.html"},{"title":"ocean_budgets_init_snapshot – Roundabout","text":"private  subroutine ocean_budgets_init_snapshot(this, ms) Snapshot values_init from the current state.  Call once\nafter the IC is set + the EOS has run, before stepping. Type Bound ocean_budgets_t Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ocean_budgets_t ), intent(inout) :: this type( multilayer_state_t ), intent(in) :: ms Calls proc~~ocean_budgets_init_snapshot~~CallsGraph proc~ocean_budgets_init_snapshot ocean_budgets_t%ocean_budgets_init_snapshot proc~diag_mask_global diag_mask_global proc~ocean_budgets_init_snapshot->proc~diag_mask_global proc~ocean_budgets_evaluate ocean_budgets_t%ocean_budgets_evaluate proc~ocean_budgets_init_snapshot->proc~ocean_budgets_evaluate proc~recompute_total_area recompute_total_area proc~diag_mask_global->proc~recompute_total_area proc~ocean_budgets_evaluate->proc~diag_mask_global proc~budget_area_field budget