vate, save :: oh_cnt_face_y_3d = 0_int64 Standalone face_y_3d primitive calls integer(kind=int64), private, save :: oh_cnt_ml_state = 0_int64 ocean_halo_exchange_ml_state whole-ML-state exchange calls integer(kind=int64), private, save :: oh_cnt_msgs = 0_int64 Total MPI ISENDs posted by the ocean halo MPI backend.\nNOT subject to the suppress depth — messages are physical MPI\noperations regardless of semantic grouping, so suppression does\nnot apply.  Zero on single-process builds (no messages posted). integer, private, save :: oh_suppress_depth = 0 When > 0 all oh_count_* increment calls (except oh_count_msgs) are no-ops. Functions public  function oh_count_suppressed () result(flag) Return .true. if suppress depth > 0 (any suppress scope is active). Arguments None Return Value logical public  function oh_counters_format () result(str) Return a one-line counter summary string. Read more… Arguments None Return Value character(len=256) One-line summary (at most 240 chars; remainder is blank-padded). public  function oh_counters_msgs () result(n) Return the total MPI ISEND post count.\nNOT included in oh_counters_total (separate physical counter). Arguments None Return Value integer(kind=int64) public  function oh_counters_total () result(total) Return the sum of all 9 semantic counters. Arguments None Return Value integer(kind=int64) Subroutines public  subroutine oh_count_bt_group () Increment the bt_group counter.\nCalled once in ocean_halo_bt_group_2d bodies. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_bt_u_mid () Increment the bt_u_mid counter.\nCalled at the mid-substep bt_ubt face_x exchange site. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_centre_2d () Increment the centre_2d standalone counter.\nCalled at the top of each ocean_halo_centre_2d body. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_centre_3d () Increment the centre_3d standalone counter.\nCalled once in ocean_halo_centre_3d (after suppressing inner 2d bumps). Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_face_x_2d () Increment the face_x_2d standalone counter.\nCalled at the top of each ocean_halo_face_x_2d body. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_face_x_3d () Increment the face_x_3d standalone counter.\nCalled once in ocean_halo_face_x_3d (after suppressing inner 2d bumps). Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_face_y_2d () Increment the face_y_2d standalone counter.\nCalled at the top of each ocean_halo_face_y_2d body. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_face_y_3d () Increment the face_y_3d standalone counter.\nCalled once in ocean_halo_face_y_3d (batched, no per-layer 2d loop). Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_ml_state () Increment the ml_state counter.\nCalled once in ocean_halo_exchange_ml_state. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_msgs (n) Increment the MPI isend post counter by n.\nNOT subject to the suppress depth: messages are physical MPI\noperations regardless of semantic grouping.  Called in the MPI rdb_ocean_halo once per exchange after each set of\nHALO_ISEND_N calls; n is the number of ISENDs just posted. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in) :: n public  subroutine oh_count_suppress_off () Decrement suppress depth (floored at 0) after a wrapper completes. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_count_suppress_on () Increment suppress depth so inner primitive increments are no-ops.\nNesting-safe: each on/off pair increments/decrements a counter so\nnested suppress pairs (ml_state wrapping 3d wrappers) work correctly. Arguments None public  subroutine oh_counters_get (bt_group, bt_u_mid, ml_state, centre_2d, centre_3d, face_x_2d, face_x_3d, face_y_2d, face_y_3d) Return all 9 semantic counters in one call. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer(kind=int64), intent(out) :: bt_group bt_group_2d call count integer(kind=int64), intent(out) :: bt_u_mid mid-substep bt_ubt face_x call count integer(kind=int64), intent(out) :: ml_state ml_state exchange call count integer(kind=int64)